category: Libs
requires: cygwin libg15render3 libg15_3
sdesc: "Provides access to extra keys and the LCD available on the logitech G15 keyboard (utilities)"
ldesc: "G15Daemon allows users access to all extra keys by decoding them and pushing
them back into the kernel via the linux UINPUT driver. This driver must be
loaded before g15daemon can be used for keyboard access."

